+        - PII_REDACTION_CATEGORY_NAME
+        - PII_REDACTION_CATEGORY_NAME_GIVEN
+        - PII_REDACTION_CATEGORY_NAME_FAMILY
+        - PII_REDACTION_CATEGORY_NUMERICAL_PII
+        - PII_REDACTION_CATEGORY_OCCUPATION
+        - PII_REDACTION_CATEGORY_ORIGIN
+        - PII_REDACTION_CATEGORY_PASSPORT_NUMBER
+        - PII_REDACTION_CATEGORY_PASSWORD
+        - PII_REDACTION_CATEGORY_PHONE_NUMBER
+        - PII_REDACTION_CATEGORY_ROUTING_NUMBER
+        - PII_REDACTION_CATEGORY_SSN
+        - PII_REDACTION_CATEGORY_SWIFT_CODE
+        - PII_REDACTION_CATEGORY_URL
+        - PII_REDACTION_CATEGORY_USERNAME
+        - PII_REDACTION_CATEGORY_VEHICLE_ID
+        - PII_REDACTION_CATEGORY_CREDIT_CARD
+        - PII_REDACTION_CATEGORY_CREDIT_CARD_EXPIRATION
+        - PII_REDACTION_CATEGORY_CVV
+        - PII_REDACTION_CATEGORY_LANGUAGE
+        - PII_REDACTION_CATEGORY_ORGANIZATION
+        - PII_REDACTION_CATEGORY_POLITICAL_AFFILIATION
+        - PII_REDACTION_CATEGORY_RELIGION
+      description: |-
+        PIIRedactionCategory is the canonical taxonomy of PII entity types a project
+         may select for redaction. It is the shared contract across Cloud, backend,
+         and the dashboard so none of them need to import the redaction library.
+
+         Each value's name maps 1:1 to the snake_case identifier the redaction model
+         emits: strip the PII_REDACTION_CATEGORY_ prefix and lowercase (see
+         PIIRedactionCategory.Canonical in Go). A guard test in cloud-observability
+         asserts this set stays in sync with redact.KnownCategories.
+
+         Numbers are permanent and assigned in append order; never renumber or reuse
+         one. Add a new category with the next free number, then classify it via
+         PIIRedactionCategory.Class in Go.
+    google.protobuf.Duration:
