+        - 1.500s
+        - 0.000000001s
+      description: |-
+        A span of time as protobuf JSON encodes it: seconds with an "s" suffix,
+        e.g. "86400s" for a day. Responses carry 0, 3, 6 or 9 fractional
+        digits ("1.500s", "0.000000001s"); requests may use 1 to 9. At most
